              "id": "text-14",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Nickel Alloy Inconel® 600 is a nickel-chromium alloy that exhibits good oxidation resistance at high temperatures and resistances against chloride environments. Due to the chromium content, this alloy was originally designed for cryogenic temperatures and contains excellent mechanical properties for high strength and good workability. This alloy is widely used in the chemical and food processing, power generation, furnace components, and many other market segments."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Nickel Alloy Inconel® 600 Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "AMS: AMS 5665"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "AS: AS 6279"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "ISO: ISO 17025"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Nickel Round Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-nickel-alloy-round-bar) offered at all Titanium Industries’ locations can be found here."
                }
              ]
